<title>ITALY: RAS premium income rises 6.8 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>RAS premium income rises 6.8 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons premium income	 13,218  (up 6.8 pct)</p>
<p>    Life premium		   4,755  (up 12.9 pct)</p>
<p>    Non-life premium	     8,463  (up 3.6 pct)</p>
<p>    Italian life premiums	up 26.6 pct</p>
<p>Note - Riunione Adriatica di Sicurta (RAS) said in a statement total investments were more than 16 trillion lire in 1996, up from 15 trillion in 1995, and related net income rose 8.8 percent to 1.262 trillion lire.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
